# shadcn Maia UI only

Deckhand’s React UI uses **shadcn/ui** with the **Maia** preset (`base-maia`, preset `bbVJxYW`) and **Tailwind CSS v4**.

Icons use **[Lucide React](https://lucide.dev/guide/react/)** (`lucide-react`) via `lucideProps()` / `Icon` in `src/components/Icon.tsx`.

## Required

- Primitives from `@/components/ui/*` (generated by shadcn CLI)
- Layout/tokens via Tailwind utility classes and CSS variables from `src/index.css`
- Root: `AppProvider` (theme + `TooltipProvider`), Sonner toasts via `@/lib/toast`
- Button events: standard `onClick` on shadcn/Radix components
- `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` for conditional classes

## Do not add

- Adobe React Spectrum (`@react-spectrum/s2`, `@adobe/react-spectrum`), Spectrum Charts, or `style()` macros
- Parallel component kits (MUI, Chakra, Ant Design) alongside shadcn
- Hand-rolled Radix wrappers that duplicate `@/components/ui`

## App helpers

Prefer shadcn primitives and small app helpers (`Tip`, `StatusBadge`, `RowMenu`, `Field`, `MoreActionsMenu`, `SegmentedControl`) under `src/components/` — do not reintroduce Spectrum providers or macros.

## Custom widgets

When shadcn has no component (e.g. xterm, custom charts), style chrome with Tailwind tokens. Do not reintroduce a second design system.
